{"3635550": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Breezevale", "steam_appid": 3635550, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4922780], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden beyond a forgotten forest lies <strong>Breezevale</strong>, a town known for its crystal crops, where humans, elves, demons, and beastfolk live side by side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the crystal crops can no longer be grown, the fields have fallen silent, and the great World Tree slowly withers at the heart of the valley.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, you find yourself in this fading world. Restore the farm, explore mysterious Crystal Zones, and help the World Tree bloom once more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌾 Grow 40+ seasonal crops</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💖 Befriend villagers and romance 10+ unique characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🦄 Raise magical creatures that evolve and assist with farming</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️ Explore dungeons and battle monsters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✨ Customize your character, farmhouse, and daily pace</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏡 Build a cozy life in a magical valley full of secrets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Romanceable Characters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635550/extras/e0a111726dd335cccccd34d0ea00f136.avif?t=1787164489\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635550/extras_big/e0a111726dd335cccccd34d0ea00f136.webp?t=1787164489 width=1560 height=2371 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden beyond a forgotten forest lies <strong>Breezevale</strong>, a town known for its crystal crops, where humans, elves, demons, and beastfolk live side by side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the crystal crops can no longer be grown, the fields have fallen silent, and the great World Tree slowly withers at the heart of the valley.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, you find yourself in this fading world. Restore the farm, explore mysterious Crystal Zones, and help the World Tree bloom once more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌾 Grow 40+ seasonal crops</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💖 Befriend villagers and romance 10+ unique characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🦄 Raise magical creatures that evolve and assist with farming</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️ Explore dungeons and battle monsters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✨ Customize your character, farmhouse, and daily pace</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏡 Build a cozy life in a magical valley full of secrets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Romanceable Characters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635550/extras/e0a111726dd335cccccd34d0ea00f136.avif?t=1787164489\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635550/extras_big/e0a111726dd335cccccd34d0ea00f136.webp?t=1787164489 width=1560 height=2371 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Start a new life on a forgotten farm. Meet fantastical residents—elf, beastkin, demon, mermaid, ghost, and more! Restore the farm, find love, raise magical creatures, explore dungeons, and uncover the mystery behind the withering World Tree.", "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Thai", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635550/c80b2cab524f3